    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmic Waves</strong> puts an entirely new spin on block destruction \u2013 the classic arcade genre made popular by games such as Breakout and Arkanoid. It merges traditional brick-breaking elements, including different block types and pickups, with many cool new features that bring greater depth, skill, and excitement to every bounce, rebound, and ricochet!\u00a0<br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/0f41c8c663118f20b086030fd44e6d01.poster.avif?t=1753783483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/0f41c8c663118f20b086030fd44e6d01.webm?t=1753783483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/0f41c8c663118f20b086030fd44e6d01.mp4?t=1753783483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A new dynamic in ball control:</strong> Utilise up to four energy towers and release force waves capable of changing a ball\u2019s momentum, trajectory, and power  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/cbd8f6d9499109402a88ea93822833ef.poster.avif?t=1753783483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/cbd8f6d9499109402a88ea93822833ef.webm?t=1753783483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/cbd8f6d9499109402a88ea93822833ef.mp4?t=1753783483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super-powered paddle action:</strong> Boost your brick-breaking with a range of special weapons, and use unlockable gadgets to further enhance paddle capabilities   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/f1fdbebacddb9ee9bc26f1b087deff08.poster.avif?t=1753783483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/f1fdbebacddb9ee9bc26f1b087deff08.webm?t=1753783483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/f1fdbebacddb9ee9bc26f1b087deff08.mp4?t=1753783483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brick-breaking with a story:</strong> Join a duo of heroic wolves and their robot sidekick as they travel through space and face animal antagonists in a light-hearted adventure </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/fe6a23d1c6da4ce302e6396dbd3c609a.avif?t=1753783483\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Station: </strong>Collect resources extracted from broken blocks or destroyed enemies and use them to increase weapon power, tower range, paddle durability and much more </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/954440b259e3a4e864b5a5073ada927e.poster.avif?t=1753783483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/954440b259e3a4e864b5a5073ada927e.webm?t=1753783483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/954440b259e3a4e864b5a5073ada927e.mp4?t=1753783483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beyond blocks:</strong> Dynamic levels include a variety of different objects \u2013 switches, gun turrets, forcefields and more can all be targeted (sometimes with explosive results!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aim for a high-score:</strong> Completing a level is just the start! You\u2019ll need to smash the target criteria if you want to get maximum points and earn an S-Rank\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Block rocking beats:</strong> Enjoy an original soundtrack by Module \u2013 the award-winning composer behind the music for iconic brick-breaker, Shatter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmic Waves</strong> puts an entirely new spin on block destruction \u2013 the classic arcade genre made popular by games such as Breakout and Arkanoid. It merges traditional brick-breaking elements, including different block types and pickups, with many cool new features that bring greater depth, skill, and excitement to every bounce, rebound, and ricochet!\u00a0<br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/0f41c8c663118f20b086030fd44e6d01.poster.avif?t=1753783483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/0f41c8c663118f20b086030fd44e6d01.webm?t=1753783483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/0f41c8c663118f20b086030fd44e6d01.mp4?t=1753783483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A new dynamic in ball control:</strong> Utilise up to four energy towers and release force waves capable of changing a ball\u2019s momentum, trajectory, and power  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/cbd8f6d9499109402a88ea93822833ef.poster.avif?t=1753783483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/cbd8f6d9499109402a88ea93822833ef.webm?t=1753783483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/cbd8f6d9499109402a88ea93822833ef.mp4?t=1753783483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super-powered paddle action:</strong> Boost your brick-breaking with a range of special weapons, and use unlockable gadgets to further enhance paddle capabilities   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/f1fdbebacddb9ee9bc26f1b087deff08.poster.avif?t=1753783483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/f1fdbebacddb9ee9bc26f1b087deff08.webm?t=1753783483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/f1fdbebacddb9ee9bc26f1b087deff08.mp4?t=1753783483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brick-breaking with a story:</strong> Join a duo of heroic wolves and their robot sidekick as they travel through space and face animal antagonists in a light-hearted adventure </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/fe6a23d1c6da4ce302e6396dbd3c609a.avif?t=1753783483\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Station: </strong>Collect resources extracted from broken blocks or destroyed enemies and use them to increase weapon power, tower range, paddle durability and much more </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/954440b259e3a4e864b5a5073ada927e.poster.avif?t=1753783483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/954440b259e3a4e864b5a5073ada927e.webm?t=1753783483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292540/extras/954440b259e3a4e864b5a5073ada927e.mp4?t=1753783483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beyond blocks:</strong> Dynamic levels include a variety of different objects \u2013 switches, gun turrets, forcefields and more can all be targeted (sometimes with explosive results!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aim for a high-score:</strong> Completing a level is just the start! You\u2019ll need to smash the target criteria if you want to get maximum points and earn an S-Rank\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Block rocking beats:</strong> Enjoy an original soundtrack by Module \u2013 the award-winning composer behind the music for iconic brick-breaker, Shatter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Blast-off for a brick-breaker adventure that\u2019s out of this world! Control a super-powered paddle and emit cosmic force waves to smash blocks, shatter forcefields and destroy machines as you embark on a heroic mission to save the universe!",
